<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-JAPAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-JAPAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $1.22 million Japan Open tennis championships on Thursday (Prefix denotes seedings):</p>
<p>Men's third round</p>
<p>1-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat 15-Magnus Norman (Sweden) 7-5 6-0</p>
<p>8-David Prinosil (Germany) beat 10-Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 6-7 (4-7) 7-6 (8-6) 7-5</p>
<p>4-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat 14-Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>6-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Henrik Holm (Sweden) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Shuzo Matsuoka (Japan) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>13-Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat 3-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>7-Martin Damm (Czeck Republic) beat Andrei Cherkasov (Russia) 7-6 (7-2) 7-5</p>
<p>Women's quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Annabel Ellwood (Australia) beat Janet Lee (U.S.) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>3-Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat 6-Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) 7-6 (8-6) 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>4-Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat Corina Morariu (U.S.) 7-6 (7-2) 6-2</p>
<p>2-Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat 5-Wang Shi-ting (Taiwan) 4-6 6-3 6-3  </p>
<p>Men's third round 16-Lionel Roux (France) beat 2-Boris Becker (Germany) 4-6 6-3 6-1</p>
</text>
